rem Turan's Water Heating
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=713

use numbers
use io
use cli

arg Limit integer = 10 ** 7

rem With d = m - 1, T(n, m) is the sum
rem of k // d for k < n. Writing a =
rem n // d and b = n - d a, values
rem 0 to a - 1 occur d times each and
rem a occurs b times:
rem T = d a (a - 1) / 2 + a b.
Divisors = 1 to Limit - 1
Quotient = Limit // Divisors
Rest = Limit - Divisors * Quotient
Full = Divisors * Quotient
Full = Full * (Quotient - 1) // 2
Terms = Full + Quotient * Rest
return Terms sum
